{"id":"9fc246f88d0f85c8","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal.md","title":"最小 ε 数","display":"df-least-epsilon-ordinal — 最小 ε 数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal","aliases":["18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal","18-df-021"],"display":"df-least-epsilon-ordinal — 最小 ε 数","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","[[18-df-epsilon-ordinal]]","[[18-df-omega-tower]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§3.3.1; fixed-point construction of Lemma 3.4.2","source_pages":"33, 35","source_pdf_pages":"43, 45","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-with-local-existence-proof"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal</span><span>18-df-021</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-least-epsilon-ordinal — 最小 ε 数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f61399ef66a953f9\" href=\"?note=f61399ef66a953f9\" title=\"18-df-epsilon-ordinal\">18-df-epsilon-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdee91a683a5c7c3\" href=\"?note=fdee91a683a5c7c3\" title=\"18-df-omega-tower\">18-df-omega-tower</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.1; fixed-point construction of Lemma 3.4.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"33, 35"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"43, 45"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-with-local-existence-proof"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Epsilon}\">\\(\\mathrm{Epsilon}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f61399ef66a953f9\" href=\"?note=f61399ef66a953f9\" title=\"18-df-epsilon-ordinal\">18-df-epsilon-ordinal</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_n(1)\">\\(\\omega_n(1)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdee91a683a5c7c3\" href=\"?note=fdee91a683a5c7c3\" title=\"18-df-omega-tower\">18-df-omega-tower</a>。定义下列序数常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a> 的序数类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\\coloneqq\\sup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\omega_n(1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_0\\coloneqq\\sup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\omega_n(1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0=\\min\\mathrm{Epsilon}=\\min\\{\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\omega^\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_0=\\min\\mathrm{Epsilon}=\\min\\{\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\omega^\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §3.3.1 的最小不动点定义，并显式给出存在见证。ω 幂在非零极限处连续，故有限塔上确界为不动点；任一不动点逐项支配从 1 起始的塔，故该上确界最小。这也避免在 Hypothesis 预先假定待定义 ε₀ 已存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-epsilon-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"f61399ef66a953f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-epsilon-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-omega-tower","status":"resolved","id":"fdee91a683a5c7c3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-omega-tower]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-epsilon-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"f61399ef66a953f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Epsilon}$ 见 [[18-df-epsilon-ordinal]]，$\\omega_n(1)$ 见 [[18-df-omega-tower]]。定义下列序数常元 $\\varepsilon_0$。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-omega-tower","status":"resolved","id":"fdee91a683a5c7c3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Epsilon}$ 见 [[18-df-epsilon-ordinal]]，$\\omega_n(1)$ 见 [[18-df-omega-tower]]。定义下列序数常元 $\\varepsilon_0$。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的序数类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex